  "reducers": {},
  "stratificationSchemes": {
    "sqrt_equal_width": {
      "label": "square-root equal width",
      "description": "n bins of equal width in sqrt(depth) between lo and hi: e_0 = lo, e_n = hi, e_i = r * r with r = sqrt(lo) + i * (sqrt(hi) - sqrt(lo)) / n, in IEEE double arithmetic. Leans range into near bins and stays well-behaved as lo approaches 0."
    }
  }
